  { 
    question: "How can I book a driving lesson assessment in Foxwood?", 
    answer: "Simply fill out our online enquiry form. We’ll discuss your goals and match you with a local instructor covering Foxwood Lane, Thanet Road, and the surrounding YO24 area."
